Package: epiAlert
Type: Package
Title: Seasonal Baselines and Alert Levels for Surveillance Counts
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("EpiStack", "Authors", email = "epistack@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: EpiStack Authors [aut, cre]
Maintainer: EpiStack Authors <epistack@example.com>
Description: Alerting layer (L2) of the EpiStack ecosystem. Builds per-region
    seasonal baselines from historical counts, flags periods above a one-sided
    upper bound and grades signals into watch, warning and alarm with
    consecutive-exceedance and ratio rules. Baselines can be evaluated for the
    latest period only or retrospectively for every period. Thresholds are data,
    not code, and can be versioned as a JSON file per project.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.6.0)
Imports: stats, utils
Suggests: epiCore
NeedsCompilation: no
URL: https://github.com/Rythonme/EpiStack
BugReports: https://github.com/Rythonme/EpiStack/issues
